app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2422371955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98288#issuecomment-2422371955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98288","id":2422371955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QYnZz","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-18T12:33:03Z","updated_at":"2024-10-18T12:36:55Z","body":"This is a pretty typical artifact from not indicating the access is not uniform explicitly in the shader.\r\n\r\nhttps://anki3d.org/resource-uniformity-bindless-access-in-vulkan/\r\n\r\n> One additional piece to the puzzle is the NonUniform SPIR-V decoration which is exposed via nonuniformEXT in GLSL and NonUniformResourceIndex() in HLSL.\r\n\r\nI don't believe access to this modifier is exposed in GDShader. It might take a while to get a feature like that added and it's a pretty highly technical modifier to expect people to know about it. I'd argue this is a bit more of a documentation issue.\r\n\r\nMy suggestion would be you attempt some other way to do this. Try just sampling both of the images and mixing based on the step UV value. That should guarantee the access to both samplers is uniform.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2422371955/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2422381453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98288#issuecomment-2422381453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98288","id":2422381453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QYpuN","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-18T12:38:09Z","updated_at":"2024-10-18T12:38:09Z","body":"> I can't reproduce it on 4.3. Possibly hardware or driver specific?\r\n\r\nYes, AMD is more prone to showing artifacts when non uniform access is not specified.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"ur